This is a list of monsters assigned by [[Duradel]], along with the pros and cons of completing the task. This table aims to empower players in choosing their tasks based on the pros and cons of each task reflecting on drops, transport and access, combat area etc. Alternatively, an analysis of tasks from an experience per hour standpoint is below.

Do tasks which give you a lot of useful resources, even if they don't offer the highest experience rates. [[Aberrant spectre]]s, [[kurask]]s and [[nechryael]]s (the ones in the [[Slayer Tower]]) drop herbs and seeds very frequently, [[gargoyle]]s drop coins and [[High level alchemy|alchable]] items, [[blue dragon]]s drop [[dragon bones]] for [[Prayer]] training. In general, it's best to block undesirable tasks that have a high [[Task weight|weight]], and skip tasks which offer little resources and/or poor experience rates.

The list assumes that [[dwarf multicannon]] is not used.

